      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778744303859,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "An Array is a collection of similar type stored in continues memory locations\nwhich can be accessed, modified using Indexing",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "An Array is a collection of similar type stored in continues memory locations\nwhich can be accessed, modified using Indexing",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Qgvj_XPr74mp2F3KmkFU2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 31927.95648447295,
      "y": -15763.287813757479,
      "width": 551.8077392578125,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBGG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 195951065,
      "version": 403,
      "versionNonce": 1338368698,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778744303859,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "for Example lets take 2D array\n\nint[][] arr = new int[3][3];",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "for Example lets take 2D array\n\nint[][] arr = new int[3][3];",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20LKjLu8aX2Ng5HhPped2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 31928.242220556935,
      "y": -15528.287813757479,
      "width": 1023.2276611328125,
      "height": 495,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBGK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1715289337,
      "version": 808,
      "versionNonce": 1644838374,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778744303859,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> so here an Array inside another array will be there \n\n> But in java the reference variable will take \n    4 Bytes of memory \n    sometimse it will be 8 Bytes also\n\n> first an array of size 3 will be created for storing\n   the memory location references\n\n> then three Independent Arrays will be created to store \n  3 values in each Array",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> so here an Array inside another array will be there \n\n> But in java the reference variable will take \n    4 Bytes of memory \n    sometimse it will be 8 Bytes also\n\n> first an array of size 3 will be created for storing\n   the memory location references\n\n> then three Independent Arrays will be created to store \n  3 values in each Array",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "E0MgQpeEqNhFV9zTFbPv5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 31932.57352942307,
      "y": -15001.01499471845,
      "width": 1172.19580078125,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
