      "versionNonce": 1227717498,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778744303859,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> So whenever we access the arr[0]  --> 3004 (address) will come \n> in that location an other array was there and \n\narr[0][1]  --> 3004 [1]",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> So whenever we access the arr[0]  --> 3004 (address) will come \n> in that location an other array was there and \n\narr[0][1]  --> 3004 [1]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
