      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778744303860,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> The formula will gives the starting base location of that \n    Index from that base location we need to read the \n    data_type_size number of bytes",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> The formula will gives the starting base location of that \n    Index from that base location we need to read the \n    data_type_size number of bytes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5kHU2VeuCsikF4ykwNUDL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 28938.19808489223,
      "y": -12580.747130039055,
      "width": 855.2158203125,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "VCkLsBTbosUV-dF8ouRUe"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGWR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1546382233,
      "version": 2035,
      "versionNonce": 905900858,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778744303860,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "from address 2012 if we read 4Bytes of memory\n2012 <--> 2016  we will get the value at arr[2]",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "from address 2012 if we read 4Bytes of memory\n2012 <--> 2016  we will get the value at arr[2]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_7ipvvtATVcBXzTAOtNBS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 28941.05529314418,
      "y": -12349.318525913079,
      "width": 1001.0877075195312,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "VCkLsBTbosUV-dF8ouRUe"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGWRG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1950382391,
      "version": 2182,
      "versionNonce": 1678275942,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778744303860,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> According to the formula if array indexing start from 1\nthen it will lead to mismatch",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> According to the formula if array indexing start from 1\nthen it will lead to mismatch",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qUcNOq0QKeZB95319GLWV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 28942.12676531215,
      "y": -12196.46139395507,
      "width": 505.83575439453125,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "VCkLsBTbosUV-dF8ouRUe"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGWRV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 375428087,
      "version": 2270,
      "versionNonce": 384859130,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778744303860,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ex: arr[1] = 2004 + ( 1 * 4 )\n             = 2008",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ex: arr[1] = 2004 + ( 1 * 4 )\n             = 2008",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lLuEtXZxeGzy6RSOdvKvB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 28941.412501396135,
      "y": -12059.675657871087,
      "width": 944.495849609375,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
